OL,3,AUS Army soldier suspected of spying for
OL,4,ARussia arrested in UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FA soldier in the US Army has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of spying for
OL,8,FRussia, British counter-terror police
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FThe 41-year-old senior serviceman was
OL,12,Farrested near Gloucester on Tuesday.
OL,14,FCounter Terrorism Policing London said
OL,15,Fthe man had been arrested under section
OL,16,Fone and section three of the National
OL,17,FSecurity Act 2023.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
